Z||000008||tgowens||05-07-2000||09:26 PM||||yes Gokart - the '88's were 'monochrome' finish -- and they were available with the black or gold lace wheels too -- just a note for anyone reading this thread -- I have a section on my site (http://www.tgowens.com/fiero) that I can use to add a picture of your Fiero so that you can send it to others online as a postcard -- take a look and if you want a photo of your Fiero included, email it to me and i'll be glad to add it!<P>Carolina, that is a GREAT lookin' GT (by the way, even tho my GT is in CA now, it was originally a North Carolina car!)||||reg||6
